# 中性示例，只访问 httpbin.org。不要把真实服务地址或密钥写进这个文件。

### 查询参数
GET {{host}}/get?name={{name}}
Accept: application/json
X-Demo-Env: {{envName}}
X-Source: {{meta.source}}

### 提交 JSON
POST {{host}}/post
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "hello": "{{name}}",
  "from": "tongyun-api"
}

### 回显请求头
GET {{host}}/headers
Accept: application/json
X-Demo-Env: {{envName}}
